From ocean population trends to how cells coordinate movement in living tissues.

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:50.480
Coordinated cell migration occurs in embryonic development, wound healing, and cancer metastasis.

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:56.360
Individual cells sense only limited local information yet still align with neighbors.

